query net_amount is:
    the net amount of which activity is which amount.

query remaining_value is:
    the remaining value of which activity is which amount.

query checks is:
    which activity fails the check which code.

query spawns is:
    which activity spawns which transaction.

query policy_after_account_value is:
    the account value of the policy after which activity is which value.

the view withdrawal is:
    the title is "Withdrawal (annuity)".
    the case is a scenario.
    the facts about "the activity" are
        the gross amount of an activity is an amount,
        the effective date of an activity is a date.
    the facts about "the policy it finds" are
        the account value of the policy before an activity is an amount,
        the issue date of the policy before an activity is a date.
    the result is the answer to query net_amount.
    the answers to "which activity fails the check which code" are listed as "Checks".
    the result shows its citations.

